{"id":"24025028685","kind":"article","title":"平庸的无能","author":"Gwern Branwen","original_authors":["Gwern Branwen"],"original_source_urls":["https://gwern.net/note/competence"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"Gwern Branwen","date":"2025-02-16","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":122,"comment_count":2,"minutes":5,"chars":2463,"keywords":["普通无能","刻意练习","专家表现","技能学习","管理实践","研究证据"],"summary":"Gwern 将普通无能概括为：长期从事某项任务仍可能反复犯基础错误，指导、反馈和刻意练习可能更关键。页面按心理学、游戏、棋类、体育、管理和物理学整理研究与案例，并附若干简评，是一份有中心主张的跨领域证据图。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/24025028685","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"-HXPFQYC\">无能是常态；大多数从事某项任务的人（即使有绩效激励或花费无数时间从事该任务）可能仍在犯一些基本错误，这些错误可以通过指导或刻意练习来纠正。</p><blockquote data-pid=\"iOPazMT9\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/index\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">经济学</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/iq/low/index\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">低智商</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/psychology/index\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">心理学</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/sociology/index\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">社会学</a><br/>2021-06-04 <b>完成</b>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/about#confidence-tags\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">确定性</a>：<b>日志</b>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/about#importance-tags\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">重要性</a>：<b>5</b>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/note/competence#backlinks\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">反向链接</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/note/competence#similars\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">相似内容</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/note/competence#link-bibliography\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">参考文献</a></blockquote><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"2cvsupEY\"> 一头为 10 次战役驮过包袱的骡子在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Eugene_of_Savoy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">尤金亲王</a>手下也不会因此成为更好的战术家，必须承认，这是对人性的侮辱，许多人在一个本应受人尊敬的职业中变老，却没有取得比这头骡子更大的进步。<br/>——<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frederick_the_Great\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">腓特烈大帝</a>，《关于战术的思考》[1⁠]</blockquote><ul><li data-pid=\"yZvbn5Zk\"><b>心理学：</b><br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"omcMgPmd\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/psychology/spaced-repetition/1921-thorndike-educationalpsychology-v2-thepsychologyoflearning.pdf#page=188\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thorndike 1921</a> 关于经验和专业知识之间较低的相关性<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"5miCDVcj\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/iq/1935-wechsler-rangeofhumancapacities.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《人类能力范围》</a>，Wechsler 1935（在有绝对表现指标的情况下，如跑步速度，约 1000 名健康正常人的样本将仅跨越约第 3 个百分位？）<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"3eW5Eaim\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Practice_(learning_method)#Deliberate_practice\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">刻意练习</a>，例如 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/psychology/1989-chambliss.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chamblis 1989</a>（不充分，但必要，且经常需要）<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"KUoukAuN\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://nintil.com/bloom-sigma/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《Bloom 的「两个标准差」问题：系统比较精熟学习法、一对一辅导和直接教学法的有效性》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"pEiU26dC\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/iq/ses/1997-gottfredson.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《一般智力因子（g）为何重要：解析日常生活的复杂性》</a>，Gottfredson 1997；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/iq/1997-gordon.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《将日常生活视为智力测试：智力及其环境的影响》</a>，Gordon 1997<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"DRwkaP9I\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.overcomingbias.com/p/stupider-than-you-realizehtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《比你想象的还要蠢》</a>（关于美国成年人的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Literacy_in_the_United_States\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">识字能力</a>；另请参阅<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/review/mcnamara\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《McNamara 的愚行》</a>）<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"ti7A0N-c\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://theonion.com/study-average-person-s-life-plan-can-only-withstand-25-1819578876/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《研究发现：普通人的人生规划仅能抵挡 25 秒的直接质疑》</a><br/> </li></ul><li data-pid=\"eEV-sbg-\"><b>游戏：</b><br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"h4ynWFrt\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.sirlin.net/articles/playing-to-win\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《为胜利而战》</a>，Sirlin 2006<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"BOdYgnMP\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://danluu.com/p95-skill/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《达到前 5% 的水平其实并不怎么样》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://danluu.com/look-stupid/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《愿意显得愚蠢》</a>，Dan Luu；<a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-title=\"《一本书的障碍》\" href=\"https://ludic.mataroa.blog/blog/you-must-read-at-least-one-book-to-ride/#ii-the-one-book-barrier\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《一本书的障碍》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://arealsociety.substack.com/p/the-dead-planet-theory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《地球死亡论：没人在真正「做事」，门槛比你想的低得多》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"EOJKS3qe\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.experimental-history.com/p/so-you-wanna-de-bog-yourself#§the-try-harder-fallacy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《加倍努力谬误》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"rbVR6X6P\"> 星际争霸：Gheed 的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/271453-worker-rush-descent-to-bronze?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《工人快攻：跌落青铜》</a>」系列文章（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/271998-worker-rush-part-2-bm-rising?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇二</a>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/272765-worker-rush-nuts-and-bolts?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇三</a>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/281817-worker-rush-part-3-a-new-approach?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇四</a>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/283221-worker-rush-part-4-rising-up?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇五</a>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/286351-worker-rush-part-5-live-to-win?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇六</a>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/304674-worker-rush-part-6-at-a-loss?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇七</a>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/308882-bronze-delving-deeper?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇八</a>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/313577-bronze-part-2-hell-is-other-people?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇九</a>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/319375-bronze-part-3-casually-cruel?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇十</a>/<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://tl.net/blogs/328804-bronze-part-4-a-legendary-league?view=all\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">续篇十一</a>）<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"sxUP1NFO\"> 国际象棋：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tyler_Cowen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tyler Cowen</a> 的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2021/02/my-days-as-a-chess-teacher.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《我的青少年国际象棋教师生涯》</a>（附：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2019/07/how-i-practice-at-what-i-do.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">他的写作心得</a>）；Joseph Wong 的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://github.com/jcw024/lichess_database_ETL/blob/main/README.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《普通人需要多长时间才能在国际象棋上「炉火纯青」？》</a>；Anderson et al 2016 年的研究<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.04956\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《以完美为基准评估人为失误》</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/articles/world-chess-championship-magnus-carlsen-ian-nepomniachtchi-seconds-11638167905\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《秒的秘密生活：世界国际象棋锦标赛背后的智囊团》</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://conversationswithtyler.com/episodes/vishy-anand/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Viswanathan Anand</a> 的访谈<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"Gxcm_xXF\"> 围棋：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/reinforcement-learning/model/alphago/2017-silver.pdf#page=3&amp;org=deepmind\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AlphaGo Zero</a> 论文；Choi et al 2021 年的研究<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=3893835\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《人工智能如何提升人类决策能力？基于 AI 围棋程序的实证研究》</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"nJAtgzVQ\"> 田径：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/magazine/2014/11/10/better-time\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《不断超越：「表现革命」如何改变田径运动及其他领域》</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/magazine/2011/10/03/personal-best\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《追求卓越：顶级运动员和歌手都有教练，你是否也需要一个？》</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20140725112211/https://www.wired.com/2012/06/ff_superhumans/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《争分夺秒：打造更强大的奥运健儿》</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/psychology/2020-maynard.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Maynard et al 2022</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"Z-g55ynK\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halo_(franchise)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">光环</a>：<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/%3Cb%3E/j%3C/b%3Eeffhuang.com/papers/HaloLearning_CHI13.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《精通战争艺术：游戏模式如何影响光环中的技能提升》</a>，Huang et al 2013<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"R9N-sxkr\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://x.com/davidalmog25/status/1708620290010362056\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">井字棋</a><br/> </li></ul><li data-pid=\"lwbqrr-H\"><b>经济学</b>：<br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"oz_L51yp\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://medium.com/conversations-with-tyler/nicholas-bloom-tyler-cowen-productivity-economics-b5714b05fc2b\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《Nicholas Bloom 谈管理、生产力和科学进步》</a>；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2018/04/lessons-from-the-profit.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《来自 The Profit 的教训》</a><br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"N_jh71uS\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2010-bloom.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《为什么管理实践在不同公司和国家之间存在差异》</a>，Bloom &amp; Van Reenen 2010<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"u2ZcMVwJ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2012-bloom.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《管理真的重要吗？来自印度的证据》</a>，Bloom et al 2012；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2020-bloom-2.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《管理干预能持续多久？来自印度的证据》</a>，Bloom et al 2020<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"kAkCAQ2Z\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2017-bloom-2.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《管理作为一种技术？》</a>，Bloom et al 2017；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://hbr.org/2017/09/why-do-we-undervalue-competent-management\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《为什么我们低估了称职的管理？》</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"Rxx_6grI\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2018-bruhn.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《咨询服务对中小企业的影响：来自墨西哥的随机试验证据》</a>，Bruhn et al 2018<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"JPjb1tHN\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2019-kotha.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《管理培训是否有助于企业家发展新企业？来自新加坡的实地实验证据》</a>，Kotha et al 2019；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2019-camuffo.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《创业决策的科学方法：来自[意大利]随机对照试验的证据》</a>，Camuffo et al 2019<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"DDzcv7Pe\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2021-jin.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《为新公司消除增长障碍：来自对两百万在线企业的创业培训实验的证据》</a>，Jin &amp; Sun 2021<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"Lbbyy5QV\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.nber.org/papers/w31192\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《零售业的管理者和生产力》</a>，Metcalfe et al 2023<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"JnSIX9Sa\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/full/10.1287/mnsc.2023.02793\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《开展业务：连锁所有权与生育诊所绩效》</a>，La Forgia &amp; Bodner 2024<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"5g_l-IjP\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2024-giorcelli.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《创造「美国式」商业方式：来自美国二战的证据》</a>，Giorcelli 2024<br/> </li></ul><li data-pid=\"n2U5Nqqr\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/iq/ses/2012-grinblatt.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《智商、交易行为与表现》</a>，Grinblatt et al 2012<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"p7SIXGvW\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/economics/2019-huising.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《超越蓝图：组织运营知识如何赋能与疏离员工》</a>，Huising 2019<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"6J8lbWE8\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://lifetime-reliability.com/tutorials/human_error_rate_table_insights/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《可靠性、可维护性与风险》附录</a>（工业任务中的人为失误：即便是最简单的任务，失误率似乎也难以低于 1/10,000——引用的最低失误率是 1/100,000，对应「浴缸注水过满」这一情形）<br/> </li></ul><li data-pid=\"wejCS2aX\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://blog.codinghorror.com/why-cant-programmers-program/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《为何程序员不会……编程？》</a>，Jeff Atwood<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"LhrXsGZg\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/computer-skill-levels/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《用户的计算机技能分布：烂出你想象》</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"XNHD15hG\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/evyBmPw9ZnzmoFmP6/experiment-a-good-researcher-is-hard-to-find\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《实验：优秀研究人员难觅》</a>；还有<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://x.com/sarah_cone/status/1760688179517264307\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">秘书</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"gqBID8Ef\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.betonit.ai/p/do-ten-times-as-much\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《十倍努力法则：看似残酷却卓有成效的建议》</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"WGPIML7L\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/ididnthaveeggs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">/r/ididnthaveeggs：《不遵循食谱却抱怨成品糟糕的评论集锦》</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"690UutAm\"><b>物理学</b>：<br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"vnTj7ukM\"><b>牛顿力学</b>：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Hestenes#Modeling_theory_and_instruction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">David Hestenes</a> 展示了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.harvardmagazine.com/2012/02/twilight-of-the-lecture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">物理系学生中亚里士多德式朴素物理学观念的顽固存在</a>，这表明他们所学到的仅仅是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/NMoLJuDJEms7Ku9XS/guessing-the-teacher-s-password\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《猜老师的密码》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>；关于使用的测试，请参见 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://pdfs.semanticscholar.org/e8ab/66bb321d467e38931cd3685d241b908c752a.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Halloun &amp; Hestenes 1985</a> 和 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://pdfs.semanticscholar.org/00d3/6b267777b670abd1a3b98a21bf662245a7c4.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hestenes et al 1992</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"CZ68cdXO\"><b>量子力学</b>：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://journals.aps.org/prper/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevSTPER.6.020121#fulltext\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《量子力学概念调查的设计与验证》</a>，McKagan et al 2010<br/> </li></ul><li data-pid=\"ZYGGRaU2\"><b>另请参阅</b>：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/terrorism-is-not-effective\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《恐怖主义并不有效》</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/socks\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《论拥有足够的袜子》</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/note/local-optima\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《局部最优与贪心选择》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/note/small-groups\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《非常规小团体的惊人效能》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/psychology/cognitive-bias/illusion-o